---
Title: Grilled PB & J
Servings: 1
Tags: American, Centerpiece
---

Put @Jam on 1 side of a @Bread Slice{2}

Put @Peanut Butter{} on the other bread

Place the breads together so spread is on the inside

@Butter exterior sides of the breads

Heat a #pan to medium heat

Place the sandwich onto the hot pan and flip when necessary to reach golden sides
